### VS Code REST Client (extension humao.rest-client). Start the server first: npm run dev
@base = http://localhost:3000

### Health check -> 200
GET {{base}}/health

### List all diagrams -> 200
GET {{base}}/diagrams

### One diagram -> 200
GET {{base}}/diagrams/1

### Missing diagram -> 404
GET {{base}}/diagrams/999

### Bad id -> 400
GET {{base}}/diagrams/abc

### Create -> 201 + Location
POST {{base}}/diagrams
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Login flow",
  "notation": "UML",
  "sourceCode": "user -> server",
  "priority": "normal",
  "owner": "carol"
}

### Invalid data -> 400 with details
POST {{base}}/diagrams
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "", "notation": "XYZ" }

### Malformed JSON -> 400
POST {{base}}/diagrams
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title":

### Replace -> 200
PUT {{base}}/diagrams/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Order processing v2",
  "notation": "BPMN",
  "sourceCode": "start -> check -> pay -> ship",
  "priority": "low",
  "owner": "anna"
}

### Delete -> 204 (repeat it -> 404)
DELETE {{base}}/diagrams/2

### Unknown route -> 404
GET {{base}}/projects

### Page 2 of size 5, sorted by title descending -> 200 (X-Total-Count has the full size)
GET {{base}}/diagrams?limit=5&offset=5&sort=title&order=desc

### Page size over 100 -> 400
GET {{base}}/diagrams?limit=1000

### Unknown sort field -> 400
GET {{base}}/diagrams?sort=password
